{"_id":"GearSpacefarer01","name":"Gear For A Spacefarer","pages":[{"_id":"GearSpacePage001","name":"Gear For A Spacefarer","type":"text","title":{"show":false,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h1>Gear For A Spacefarer</h1><p>The Cadwal Trade Depot is a fleet of merchant ships that travel across the stars avoiding local tax laws by never selling their wares while docked. The ships are large enough to act as ports with smaller ships coming and going at every hour. The ships stay in orbit for one to two weeks before leaving for another system to sell their wares elsewhere.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The CTD Lucille is a C Class Port, with a mostly android staff. You can find anything for purchase here listed in the core rules as well as what is found inside this pamphlet. Weaponry can only be legally purchased if you can provide proof you work for a private military company.</p>"},"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GearSpacePage002","name":"Entry Requirements","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<p>In order to enter any trade depot ships one must declare that no dangerous materials such as but not limited to:</p><ul><li>Animals Known to be Carrying Pathogens</li><li>Artificial Gravity Disruptors</li><li>Corrosive Liquids</li><li>Explosives</li><li>Flammable Liquids</li><li>Individuals with an Officially Recognized Corporate Bounty out for Their Arrest</li><li>Non PMC Sanctioned Weapons</li><li>Plants Known to be Carrying Pathogens</li><li>Super Magnets</li><li>Xenobiological Substances</li></ul><p>The presence of these objects upon docking can lead to refusal of service and or confiscation of all offending goods.</p>"},"sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageUtils0001","name":"Utilities","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Airlock Foam</td><td>50cr</td><td>Fast-setting foam that can create an airtight seal that lasts a week.</td></tr><tr><td>Algal Starter Kit</td><td>20cr</td><td>A dehydrated shelf-stable algae to be used in biofuel generation.</td></tr><tr><td>Disposable Boosters (6x)</td><td>300cr</td><td>Single-use boosters designed to attach onto flat surfaces to help move objects in 0g.</td></tr><tr><td>Jerry Can</td><td>20cr</td><td>Holds 20L of a liquid.</td></tr><tr><td>Mag Gloves</td><td>40cr</td><td>Grants a magnetic grip to the wearer, allowing them to hold onto ferromagnetic objects with ease.</td></tr><tr><td>Portable Gravity Generator</td><td>5kcr</td><td>Creates a 1g environment in a 150m environment. Consumes a Warp Core every two weeks.</td></tr><tr><td>Light Drone</td><td>200cr</td><td>A small treaded drone that shines light in a 15 meter radius all around it. 0g spider drone models can travel along any surface regardless of gravity but gives [-] on Fear Saves made in its presence (+100cr).</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":200000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageLeisure01","name":"Leisure","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lottery Tickets</td><td>2cr</td><td>Possible payments from Blackstar Galactic Casio Division.</td></tr><tr><td>Porno Mag</td><td>10cr</td><td>Incredibly Saucy\u2122.</td></tr><tr><td>VR Movie</td><td>30cr</td><td>Requires a Slicksocket to use.</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":300000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageMedical01","name":"Medical","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AutoInjector</td><td>75cr</td><td>An armband lined with microneedles that can inject a substance into the wearer via remote signal.</td></tr><tr><td>MedMonitor</td><td>60cr</td><td>A small worn device that can send blood pressure and heart rate data back to a control center.</td></tr><tr><td>PF95 Mask (x10)</td><td>15cr</td><td>Disposable masks that filter out 95% of microparticles that pass through. Rated for 8 hours of wear.</td></tr><tr><td>Sterilizing Concentrate</td><td>50cr</td><td>Bio-engineered bacteriophage that activates in contact with water and makes the infected bacteria produce antibiotics.</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":400000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageDrugs0001","name":"Drugs","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Refuel Station Impotence Pill</td><td>10cr</td><td>Not technically illegal, not technically safe for human consumption. Taking a pill forces you to make a Body Save or vomit and have a migraine for the following hours.</td></tr><tr><td>Spacer Edibles (x12)</td><td>60cr</td><td>Hyper-concentrated cannabinoid gummies designed to take up as little space as possible. Provides +10 to Comfort Saves while under the influence.</td></tr><tr><td>Stim-a-Tac (x10)</td><td>50cr</td><td>A chewable stimulant used to stay focused and awake on 24 hour plus shifts. [-] on Fear Saves while under the influence. There is a danger of addiction if used frequently.</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":500000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageElect0001","name":"Electronic","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Atmospheric Detector</td><td>50cr</td><td>Detects atmospheric pressure and composition and displays if the atmosphere is breathable for humans.</td></tr><tr><td>Artificial Voice Box</td><td>20cr</td><td>Distorts the sound of a speaker's voice to be unrecognizable.</td></tr><tr><td>Mini Projector</td><td>300cr</td><td>Can project a 10-second recording on a loop with sound.</td></tr><tr><td>Motion Detector</td><td>20cr</td><td>Sends a small electrical pulse upon detecting motion in a small area.</td></tr><tr><td>Trail Camera</td><td>40cr</td><td>A motion-activated camera that records 1 minute of black and white video upon activation.</td></tr><tr><td>Translator</td><td>5kcr</td><td>Scans and translates written text into any other language; nearly all metaphorical meaning is lost. Add spoken word translation (+500cr).</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":600000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}},{"_id":"GfsPageMisc00001","name":"Misc.","type":"text","title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<table><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>COST</th><th>DESCRIPTION</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Quick Inflate Life Raft</td><td>200cr</td><td>A compact life raft that inflates with the pull of a single cord; fits in a rucksack.</td></tr><tr><td>SynthCoffee Maker</td><td>100cr</td><td>Designed to make the perfect cup of SynthCoffee. Does not work with real coffee.</td></tr><tr><td>Vibe Suit</td><td>2kcr</td><td>An experimental diving suit for sand. The vibe suit loosens the particles to allow \"swimming\" through the sand. AP:4, O2: 8 hrs, Speed: [-].</td></tr></tbody></table>"},"sort":700000,"ownership":{"default":-1},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1685936572185,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
